       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 10,000 mg three times daily comes to 30 g a day, which is more than seven times the usual adult maximum of 4 g a day. A dose that high risks severe hepatotoxicity and acute liver failure. Even a single 10 g dose is in the range where toxicity is a concern for a 70 kg adult.\n\nDid you mean **1,000 mg by mouth three times daily**? That's 3 g a day, which is within the standard range. Other common regimens are 650 mg every 6 hours or 500 to 1,000 mg every 6 to 8 hours, with a total of no more than 4 g a day (or less if risk factors apply).\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you really do intend 10,000 mg, I'd need you to confirm that explicitly. I'd also suggest checking with pharmacy first."
